[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:07.400",
    "text": "这制冷技术是由机器的。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": "00:00:07.600",
    "end": "00:00:09.000",
    "text": "你今天咋这么爱学习呢？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": "00:00:09.300",
    "end": "00:00:22.000",
    "text": "我们厂里头今天要来专家指导工作，说别个才得了国家技术人才奖，我们省头只有一个，我是车间组长，要负责介绍设备，我才不想在专家面前臊皮。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": "00:00:22.600",
    "end": "00:00:27.000",
    "text": "放心，你那么认真，那个专家肯定不会难为你。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": "00:00:27.100",
    "end": "00:00:33.000",
    "text": "嗯，这个周期是，她那点事情我也不想说。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": "00:00:33.100",
    "end": "00:00:37.000",
    "text": "谢春红，听说你的小姑子二婚了，嫁给哪个了？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": "00:00:37.700",
    "end": "00:00:46.500",
    "text": "哎呀，晓不得哦，哎，我之前给她介绍一个，她都不要，非要自己去找，哎呀，二婚都没喊我们。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": "00:00:46.700",
    "end": "00:00:49.500",
    "text": "嗯，说不定嫁得撇怕臊皮。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": "00:00:50.700",
    "end": "00:00:54.000",
    "text": "不得哦，我看她那个手表，还是海鸥牌的哦。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": "00:00:54.500",
    "end": "00:00:58.000",
    "text": "咋可能呢，她啷个买得起啊，你看拐了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": "00:00:58.100",
    "end": "00:00:59.000",
    "text": "真的啊？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": "00:01:01.200",
    "end": "00:01:03.000",
    "text": "厂里面的专家到了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": "00:01:18.600",
    "end": "00:01:23.500",
    "text": "妈哟，这专家好帅哦，咋这么年轻哦。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": "00:01:23.600",
    "end": "00:01:27.000",
    "text": "不晓得他结婚没有，要是能嫁给他就好了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": "00:01:27.100",
    "end": "00:01:29.500",
    "text": "你妖艳儿啥子，我还差不多。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": "00:01:29.600",
    "end": "00:01:31.500",
    "text": "想啥子，你娃儿都有了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": "00:01:50.000",
    "end": "00:01:53.000",
    "text": "虽然也想和他说一句，我。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": "00:01:53.100",
    "end": "00:01:56.500",
    "text": "老婆，哎，嗯。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": "00:01:57.500",
    "end": "00:02:00.000",
    "text": "中午慌到出门，饭盒都没带。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": "00:02:00.800",
    "end": "00:02:02.500",
    "text": "你不是爱我。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  }
]